WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
The food in this Xiangjiang Hotel tastes great

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,640
Especially the specialty catering department on the third floor

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,120
throughout Shonan

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,600
They are all one of the best

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,370
Qingsi is quite familiar with this place.

6
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:13,850
Used to come here often

7
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:18,180
Which big boss brought you here? Secretary Zhao

8
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,020
You can eat indiscriminately, but you can't talk indiscriminately.

9
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,440
I'm just saying that the food is delicious

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,520
Are you guarding me in a weird way?

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,900
I'm just curious

12
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,700
You used to be a big anchor

13
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,580
Entering and leaving a high-end hotel with the kidnapped elder brother

14
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,580
Give it a try too

15
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,780
I tried taking my mother here to eat once

16
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,700
My mom works as a cleaner here

17
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,700
humiliated in public

18
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,980
I was so angry that I ran away and asked for the bag.

19
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:40,060
Are you satisfied with taking her to consume and fight back?

20
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,800
Sorry, Qingsi

21
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,740
I really don't know that's the case

22
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,500
i apologize to you
